Subject: [PATCH 06/19] 0006-ai-decision-deadline.patch

---
 .../com/wingedsheep/ai/engine/AIPlayer.kt     |  3 +-
 .../com/wingedsheep/ai/engine/Strategist.kt   | 45 +++++++++++++------
 .../ai/engine/budget/DecisionBudget.kt        |  3 ++
